---
title: Photon Ring — System Architecture
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph KernelSpace["Kernel Space"]
        Detectors["20 Rootkit Detectors\n(ftrace / kprobes / tracepoints)"]
        Watchlist["Watchlist\n39 Critical Kernel Symbols"]
        ArchAbstract["Architecture Abstraction\nx86_64 / ARM64"]
        EventMgr["Event Manager\nPer-CPU Ring Buffers\nSeverity Classification"]
        Crypto["Crypto Engine\nAES-256-GCM\nHKDF Key Rotation"]
        CharDev["/dev/photon_ring\nCharacter Device"]
        Dmesg["dmesg\nKernel Ring Buffer"]
    end

    subgraph UserSpace["User Space"]
        Agent["Photon Agent\nTLS 1.3 Encrypted Relay"]
        Server["Remote Server\nFrame Decryption & Indexing"]
        Daemon["Python Daemon\ndmesg Polling & Parsing"]
        JSONLog["JSON Logger\nDaily JSONL Files"]
    end

    subgraph Visualization["Visualization"]
        ES["Elasticsearch"]
        Kibana["Kibana Dashboard"]
    end

    %% Detector support
    Watchlist -.->|symbol lookup| Detectors
    ArchAbstract -.->|register access| Detectors

    %% Primary path (encrypted channel)
    Detectors -->|events| EventMgr
    EventMgr -->|encrypt| Crypto
    Crypto -->|queued frames| CharDev
    CharDev -->|read frames| Agent
    Agent -->|TLS relay| Server
    Server -->|index| ES

    %% Fallback path (dmesg)
    Detectors -->|printk| Dmesg
    Dmesg -->|poll & parse| Daemon
    Daemon -->|bulk index| ES
    Daemon -->|log| JSONLog

    %% Visualization
    ES --> Kibana

    %% Styling
    classDef kernel fill:#2d3748,stroke:#4a5568,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef user fill:#1a365d,stroke:#2b6cb0,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef viz fill:#22543d,stroke:#38a169,color:#e2e8f0

    class Detectors,Watchlist,ArchAbstract,EventMgr,Crypto,CharDev,Dmesg kernel
    class Agent,Server,Daemon,JSONLog user
    class ES,Kibana viz
